                "fragmentSource": "void main()\n{\n    fragColor.a = 1;\n    if (ssiData[0] == 8)\n        fragColor.rgb = vec3(1,0,0);\n    else\n        fragColor.rgb = vec3(1,1,0);\n    if (reset)\n    {\n        atomicExchange(ssiData[0], 0);\n        atomicExchange(ssiData[1], 0);\n    }\n}",
